From: Moraxyc <i@qaq.li>
Subject: [PATCH] wscript: link ldb_match_test against replace

On musl, libreplace provides rep_strtoull which ldb_match_test references.
Add `replace` to ldb_match_test's deps so linking succeeds.

--- a/wscript
+++ b/wscript
@@ -499,7 +499,7 @@ def build(bld):
 
         bld.SAMBA_BINARY('ldb_match_test',
                          source='tests/ldb_match_test.c',
-                         deps='cmocka ldb',
+                         deps='cmocka ldb replace',
                          install=False)
 
         bld.SAMBA_BINARY('ldb_key_value_test',
